    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31249" root="عيق" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْقٌ</span></b>  [as inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاقَ</span> having <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَعِيقُ</span> for its
aor.] is syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْقٌ</span> [as inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاقَ</span> having
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَعُوقُ</span> for its aor.], (O, K, TA,) signifying The
act of <i>hindering, preventing, impeding, withholding,</i> or <i>turning back</i> or <i>away.</i> (TA.)

